            "notes": "# Round 6 Notes \u2013 [Juno](hero_035c63b7-084c-4abd-9de5-c9a00e9b6a18)\ud83e\ude90\n\n## Power Choice:\n\n-**None this round**\n\n## Items:\n\n-[Solar Shielding](item_804fd8cd-78bd-46ee-a89f-20a6c9cccdcc) \u2192 +15%[Ability Power](stat_ability_power) + heals allies via shields every second in [Hyper Ring](ability_54d2f048-f78c-47d5-a4eb-58ac619c9d4a).\n\n## Alternative / situational picks:\n\n-[Boosted Rockets](item_c3e0738f-cce2-431a-ad52-39176df84923) if you expect heavy dive or need more mobility + damage reduction.\n\n-[Red Promise Regulator](item_6a273bc5-41cc-4e81-b96b-ec373016518e) if you use [Orbital Ray](ability_a993f4c7-9299-4ee1-8dec-6e22ef1e7d2e) often and want frequent cooldown resets.\n\n**Gameplan:\nWith [Solar Shielding](item_804fd8cd-78bd-46ee-a89f-20a6c9cccdcc), push to stay inside your [Hyper Ring](ability_54d2f048-f78c-47d5-a4eb-58ac619c9d4a) and stack your [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) + [Pulsar Torpedoes](ability_fd63ee02-e01a-49bd-a75d-0e78efafca88) DPS/healing. The shields will help your team survive poke / burst, letting your healing output shine. If you go for [Boosted Rockets](item_c3e0738f-cce2-431a-ad52-39176df84923), play more mobile \u2014 dodge projectiles, use [Glide Boost](ability_db59585d-49a7-4b80-b644-a1b3405b3b76) smartly to stay alive.**",
