            "notes": "# Round 7 Notes \u2013 [Juno](hero_035c63b7-084c-4abd-9de5-c9a00e9b6a18)\ud83e\ude90\n\n## Power Choice:\n\n-[Hyper Healer](item_108336b3-54d2-4d69-8ea4-c2da5affb7ca) \u2192 Gives Overhealth to allies affected by [Hyper Ring](ability_54d2f048-f78c-47d5-a4eb-58ac619c9d4a). \n\n## Upgrade Item:\n\n-Upgrade [Lock-On Shield](item_220287f8-1dc5-4a6c-9e86-c14cf970b689) \u2192 [Boosted Rockets](item_c3e0738f-cce2-431a-ad52-39176df84923) (if you can get that epic item in your shop) \u2013 gives you more damage reduction and better mobility/survival.\n\n## Final Items:\n\n-[Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a)\n\n-[Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6)\n\n-[PulStar Destroyers](item_707ad8c7-a153-4140-b4bc-1f23f7d7a648)\n\n-[Long Range Blaster](item_9dfc20e8-9a7b-4576-bdca-d75ada1b369b)\nSolar Shielding (Epic Ability + shield + AP)\n\n-[Boosted Rockets](item_c3e0738f-cce2-431a-ad52-39176df84923)\n\n## **Gameplan:\n\n-Stay on the edges of fights where you can safely use [Pulsar Torpedoes](ability_fd63ee02-e01a-49bd-a75d-0e78efafca88) +[Hyper Ring](ability_54d2f048-f78c-47d5-a4eb-58ac619c9d4a).\n\n-Use Mediblaster aggressively, especially to hit grouped allies/enemies to benefit from [Long Range Blaster](item_9dfc20e8-9a7b-4576-bdca-d75ada1b369b).\n\n-Use [Glide Boost](ability_db59585d-49a7-4b80-b644-a1b3405b3b76) + [Boosted Rockets](item_c3e0738f-cce2-431a-ad52-39176df84923) mobility to reposition, dodge heavy burst, stay alive.\n\n-Make [Hyper Ring](ability_54d2f048-f78c-47d5-a4eb-58ac619c9d4a) count \u2014 stack shields + Overhealth, so your team can outlast the enemy.**",
